{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify Liquid and CSS developer. Build a fully responsive custom Shopify section that 100% replicates the content, layout hierarchy, and design structure of the provided image "image_513586.jpg".
    
    ### 1. Global Integration & Core Layout
    - **Theme Variables:** The section must inherit the active theme's native font family (`var(--font-heading-family)`, `var(--font-body-family)` or equivalent), global max-width settings, and base container classes (e.g., `page-width`, `container`, or `wrapper`) to ensure it integrates seamlessly into the store layout.
    - **Section Max Width:** Ensure the section contents adhere to the theme's standard content width, centered horizontally with proper responsive side padding.
    - **Background:** Clean white background (`#FFFFFF`).
    
    ### 2. Header Elements (Centered)
    - **Badge:** A small, centered uppercase tag reading "DEPLOYED AT SCALE". Give it a very soft gray background badge layout with subtle padding and slightly rounded corners.
    - **Main Heading:** "Trusted by Leading Retailers" in a prominent, bold, deep dark navy color. 
    - **Subheading:** Centered, comfortable line-height, muted gray text reading: "Flow conversion analytics deployed across specialty retail, fashion, and multi-brand operations throughout Japan."
    
    ### 3. Key Stat Counter Grid (Middle Row)
    Create a 4-column equal-width horizontal grid on desktop that gracefully wraps or adjusts to a 2x2 grid on tablet and stacks vertically on mobile.
    - **Column 1:**
      - Stat: "500+" (Large, bold, dark navy text)
      - Label: "Active Stores" (Small, muted gray text below)
    - **Column 2:**
      - Stat: "50+" (Large, bold, dark navy text)
      - Label: "Retail Brands" (Small, muted gray text below)
    - **Column 3:**
      - Stat: "98.5%" (Large, bold, dark navy text)
      - Label: "Measurement Accuracy" (Small, muted gray text below)
    - **Column 4:**
      - Stat: "99.9%" (Large, bold, dark navy text)
      - Label: "Platform Uptime" (Small, muted gray text below)
    
    ### 4. Case Study Callout Box (Bottom Banner)
    - **Container Styling:** A large full-width card with a deep navy solid background (`#0E2A3A` or similar matching the dark colors in image_513586.jpg) and clean rounded corners (~16px). Inside, use a generous layout padding.
    - **Card Title:** "Case Study: Specialty Fashion Chain" in bold white text at the top left.
    - **Metrics 3-Column Grid:** Below the title, implement a 3-column horizontal grid layout:
      - **Metric 1:** 
        - Value: "+18%" (Large, bright lime/olive green text)
        - Subtext: "Conversion rate improvement across 45 stores over 6-month period" (Small, soft white/light gray text)
      - **Metric 2:** 
        - Value: "-12%" (Large, bright lime/olive green text)
        - Subtext: "Labor cost reduction through traffic-aligned staffing optimization" (Small, soft white/light gray text)
      - **Metric 3:** 
        - Value: "92%" (Large, bright lime/olive green text)
        - Subtext: "Store manager daily dashboard adoption after 3-month deployment" (Small, soft white/light gray text)
    - **Call-to-Action Button:** Placed at the bottom left of the dark card.
      - Background color: Bright lime/olive green block color.
      - Text: "Read Full Case Study →" in bold, high-contrast dark text.
      - Shape: Rounded pill layout.
    
    ### 5. Shopify Liquid & Schema Requirements
    - Wrap all textual data, metrics, and button links into a clean Shopify schema architecture (`settings` and blocks) so they can be easily modified via the Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Use CSS Flexbox and Grid utilities to ensure that desktop alignments map beautifully down to mobile devices without breaking layouts. Keep custom CSS self-contained to avoid conflict with the existing theme.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-trust-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_mobile }}px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_desktop }}px 0;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: var(--page-width, 1600px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-trust-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-trust-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.badge_text_color }};
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ai-trust-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-trust-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 550px) {
    .ai-trust-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    .ai-trust-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-trust-stat-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_value_color }};
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }


  .ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.stat_label_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-case-study-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.case_study_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.case_study_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-case-study-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 48px 56px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-case-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.case_study_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 32px 0;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-case-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-metrics-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-metrics-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-metric-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .ai-trust-metric-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: {{ block.settings.metric_value_color }};
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-metric-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 48px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-metric-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: var(--font-body-family);
    color: {{ block.settings.metric_description_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-metric-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }
  }

  .ai-trust-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.cta_button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.cta_button_text_color }};
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .ai-trust-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-trust-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
      padding: 16px 32px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-trust-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-trust-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-trust-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.badge_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-trust-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.badge_text }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-trust-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} h1">
          {{ block.settings.heading }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <p class="ai-trust-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.subheading }}
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-trust-stats-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.stat_1_value != blank %}
        <div class="ai-trust-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2">
            {{ block.settings.stat_1_value }}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.stat_1_label }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.stat_2_value != blank %}
        <div class="ai-trust-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2">
            {{ block.settings.stat_2_value }}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.stat_2_label }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.stat_3_value != blank %}
        <div class="ai-trust-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2">
            {{ block.settings.stat_3_value }}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.stat_3_label }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.stat_4_value != blank %}
        <div class="ai-trust-stat-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-value-{{ ai_gen_id }} h2">
            {{ block.settings.stat_4_value }}
          </div>
          <div class="ai-trust-stat-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.stat_4_label }}
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-trust-case-study-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.case_study_title != blank %}
        <h3 class="h3 ai-trust-case-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.case_study_title }}
        </h3>
      {% endif %}

      <div class="ai-trust-metrics-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.metric_1_value != blank %}
          <div class="ai-trust-metric-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_1_value }}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_1_description }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.metric_2_value != blank %}
          <div class="ai-trust-metric-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_2_value }}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_2_description }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.metric_3_value != blank %}
          <div class="ai-trust-metric-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-value-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_3_value }}
            </div>
            <div class="ai-trust-metric-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.metric_3_description }}
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if block.settings.cta_button_text != blank %}
        <a
          href="{{ block.settings.cta_button_link }}"
          class="ai-trust-cta-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        >
          {{ block.settings.cta_button_text }}
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M6 12L10 8L6 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </a>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

